# config/key.local — the TE2 content key (AES-128) used by the firmware
# container tools. GITIGNORED: never commit this file.
#
# How to get the key:
#   1. Recommended: scripts/00_fetch_third_party.sh extracts it from the
#      public upstream tooling (galaxy4public/hkmcavn-tools -> xcrypt/xcrypt.py,
#      the KEY constant) and writes it here automatically.
#   2. Manually: copy the 32-char hex string onto the first line of this file.
#   3. Or: export TE2_CONTENT_KEY=<32 hex chars> instead of using this file.
#
# This is the OEM firmware content-encryption key. It is NOT distributed with
# this repository; the device owner recovers it from the public community
# tooling that documents the container format.

00000000000000000000000000000000
